# ໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ຄວາມເກັບເປັນ LF ໃນ repo ສະເໝີ (ກັນບັນຫາ Windows/Linux ຕ່າງກັນ)
# Store text files with LF in the repo — keeps Windows and the Linux build server in sync.
* text=auto eol=lf

# ໄຟລ໌ຮູບ/ວິດີໂອ/ເອກະສານ ເປັນ binary ຫ້າມ Git ແກ້ໄຂ
# Binary assets — Git must never rewrite these.
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.pdf   binary
